{"id":"d6a1ab60bf57b2aa","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-lob-to-godel.md","title":"Löb Theorem Implies First Incompleteness","display":"prop-lob-to-godel — Löb Theorem Implies First Incompleteness","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-lob-to-godel","aliases":["92-prop-lob-to-godel"],"display":"prop-lob-to-godel — Löb Theorem Implies First Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[92-thm-lob-theorem]]","[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]","[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","[[92-prop-godel-to-lob]]","[[92-df-consistent]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-lob-to-godel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-lob-to-godel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-lob-to-godel — Löb Theorem Implies First Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd30fbde88ab93eb\" href=\"?note=fd30fbde88ab93eb\" title=\"92-thm-lob-theorem\">92-thm-lob-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"02b34261c2cb199c\" href=\"?note=02b34261c2cb199c\" title=\"92-thm-first-incompleteness\">92-thm-first-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b176a5adc751091\" href=\"?note=3b176a5adc751091\" title=\"92-prop-godel-to-lob\">92-prop-godel-to-lob</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lob\\text{-}to\\text{-}godel}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow G\\nvdash\\gamma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lob\\text{-}to\\text{-}godel}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow G\\nvdash\\gamma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Löb定理给出Gödel句不可证这一侧；完整的第一不完备性结论还需处理其否定不可证</li>\n<li>证明：\n<ol>\n<li>Gödel句在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证等价于参数为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>的Löb固定点方程</li>\n<li>反设<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\gamma\">\\(G\\vdash\\gamma\\)</span>；由固定点双条件得到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\to\\bot_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>由Löb定理得到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\bot_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\bot_G\\)</span>，与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>矛盾</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>因而在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>相容时不能有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\gamma\">\\(G\\vdash\\gamma\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"fd30fbde88ab93eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-lob-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-first-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"02b34261c2cb199c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-prop-godel-to-lob","status":"resolved","id":"3b176a5adc751091","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-prop-godel-to-lob]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)$ (Gödel-sentence predicate, see [[92-df-godel-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (external consistency predicate, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)","display":